# Ignore all course module folders (keep repo root clean and flat for submission)
Module 1 - Introduction/
Module 2 - Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)/
Module 3 - Interactive Visual Analytics and Dashboard/
Module 4 - Predictive Analysis (Classification)/
Module 5 - Present Your Data-Driven Insights/

# Ignore all markdown notes and quizzes except root README.md
*.md
!README.md

# Ignore MS Word documents and temporary office locks
*.docx
~$*
Final Project - Data Science Capstone.pdf

# Ignore Python cache and checkpoints
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.system_generated/
*.tmp

# Ignore generated output files in generator directory (only track scripts & assets)
presentation_generator/*.pdf
presentation_generator/*.pptx
